    {
        "text": "The nights of deep autumn are cold in Ursus. Snow falls from the branches as the cold winds blow."
    },
    {
        "text": "The crowd has already dispersed. There is no light coming from the distant huts."
    },
    {
        "text": "A tiny flicker of flame still burns on the charred firewood in the middle of the clearing, clinging to its last gasp of life as the north winds tear at it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": "sn",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_firewood_throw",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_warmbonfire_loop",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a",
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "A piece of thick firewood is thrown into the pile, and sparks fly in the air."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "They...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "They found us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dry firewood lies in ash, slowly becoming charred and twisted, before being swallowed by the leaping flames."
    },
    {
        "text": "The fire shines upon the face of the feeble Infected, but he feels no warmth."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people here... everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "They must be wiped away... like Ganea was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This way, they will never...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will never lose their goodness, nor abandon purity...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their souls shall never be defiled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "He is in pain, a pain that penetrates his heart like a needle."
    },
    {
        "text": "He is cold, shivering like he just fell into a frozen lake."
    },
    {
        "text": "He must make himself warm again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_firewood_throw",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
