    },
    {
        "text": "One piece, two pieces, three pieces."
    },
    {
        "text": "One bundle, two bundles, three bundles."
    },
    {
        "text": "The flame that was so faint now pokes its head from the gaps in the wood like a burning demon, threatening to touch its creator with its tongue."
    },
    {
        "text": "The frail miner picks up a burning firewood and walks toward the silent houses."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
