    },
    {
        "text": "Asleep... asleep!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're all asleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "You do not know what desperation awaits you, what judgment you will face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aiding and abetting the Infected before selling them out. Blissful ignorance, docile as a burdenbeast!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it is alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will help you. I can help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For I shall meditate...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "text": "And share...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In your pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The madman carries the torch of fear, but the flame can no longer stem the cold."
    },
    {
        "text": "The cold pierces his bones. It comes from Oripathy, from the wind, from Ursus."
    },
    {
        "text": "He needs warmth."
    },
    {
        "text": "He sees a large pile of hay."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He throws the torch."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cleansing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The flames awaken all that has withered."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1971_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Salvation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawley"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
