    {
        "text": "The ringing continues in his head. In the nightmare, Rankin is clinging to the last vestige of cognition and sanity."
    },
    {
        "text": "His sensations are returning, but the wailing grown nearer, not more distant."
    },
    {
        "text": "He forces himself up and staggers towards the door of the tent, seeking a breath of fresh air."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
