    {
        "text": "Hot air rushes at him, evaporating the sweat in an instant."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the blink of an eye, all the feelings return to his body."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is not a dream. It is real. The stuff of his nightmares has found a foothold in reality."
    },
    {
        "text": "Everywhere, people are fleeing, as the houses that once offered refuge are devoured by fire."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the gushing smoke, the scent of charred despair clutches at everyone's throats like a demonic claw. How tiny is man in the presence of terror."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
