    {
        "text": "The food we traded for is still inside. I have to go in\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Miner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1963_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now is not the time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rankin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wake everyone! Get them out of the village! Go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rankin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "But his commands do not bring order to the crowd. Fear continues to spread unchecked."
