    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": true,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Rankin and Vetochki dart through the fire. The houses on both sides of them are burning, and the slightest misstep could set their clothes on fire."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4207_branch_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babushka... Babushka!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vetochki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rankin wants to yell too, but the feeling of helplessness continues to accumulate in his heart. It is stuck in his throat, preventing him from making a sound, preventing him from breathing."
    },
    {
        "text": "He knows full well what a fire like this means for an invalid old woman."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4207_branch_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Uchitel</i>, I... you... mm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vetochki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the smoke-filled intersection, Vetochki covers her mouth and points to herself, then at Rankin, and finally towards the fork in the path."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1963_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Vetochki... you must not go off on your own... listen to me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rankin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4207_branch_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Uchitel!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vetochki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl's face is red as tears flow from her eyes. She holds her hands together in a strange gesture of prayer."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is not praying to the Tsar, nor to the Yurodstvo. She is praying to Rankin."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1963_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rankin"
    },
