    {
        "text": "A shadow flashes across their vision. He is limping, but there is an unusual strength in his steps, as though he is being drawn in by something."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1963_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hawley? Where are you going?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rankin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hunched figure ignores Rankin's cries, walking towards the sea of flames at the end of the path."
    },
    {
        "text": "Surrounded by the bright light of fire, his figure casts no shadow. He prepares to welcome baptism by fire, like the Yurodstvo walking towards the execution grounds in legend."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
